    prompt: 'Refer to the exhibit. Which switch in this configuration will be elected as the root bridge? SW1: 0C:E0:38:41:86:07, SW2: 0C:0E:15:22:05:97, SW3: 0C:0E:15:1A:3C:9D, SW4: 0C:E0:18:A1:B3:19',
