    prompt: 'Refer to the exhibit. Considering that SW1 is fully configured for all traffic, the SW4 and SW9 links to SW1 have been configured, the SW4 interface Gi0/1 and Gi0/0 on SW9 have been configured, and the remaining switches have had all VLANs added to their VLAN database — which configuration establishes a successful ping from PC2 to PC7 without interruption to traffic flow between other PCs?',
